# SR10 (STOP, E: never run): the four-card platform replay of the NEW production image: the node agent's serving sequence in a copy of its container running the THIN LAYER on tp4-serve-11 (@THIN_LAYER_IMAGE@:
# built by the operator on the window image BEFORE the window and pre-pulled into the rig daemon by manifest-list digest). The replay sets no profile: it boots the traffic profile BY THE IMAGE DEFAULT. READ the vLLM
# subprocess log from the container (never docker logs): '[QWEN-C2] profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-traffic: vLLM argv', the P150x4 mesh, the extent block, the request-warm line BEFORE the block capture, admission passed with no
# UNQUALIFIED, prefix installed, the Lever N install and warm lines, the prefill warm checks; the :tt alias advertised before and after the restart. PASS: 'PLATFORM_REPLAY passed=True'. The replay turns the session cap
# OFF, so the cap is read live after placement. The thinking-budget smoke is NOT run here (the budget path is untouched by Lever N and ran in the ship pack's SR10): add C2_REPLAY_BUDGET_SMOKE=1 and 35 minutes
# if the owner asks. The box runs the replay under an interrupt timeout so its own cleanup removes its container.
# TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the W-2 window pack (tp4-w2-levern-jobs: Lever N robustness, then the cutover; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/stage1-windows and push the job's tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Names no rig, card, host or registry. ORDER.txt has the order,
# the classes, the minutes, the boxes, the tags and every rule. C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-11 is the window image (the combined branch's engine with the Lever N traffic profile baked in as its
# default); a job that names tp4-serve-10 runs the production base image. C2_BOX_MINUTES is the job's box: the workflow enforces it from inside, it never cancels a run.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset replay
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-11
C2_PLATFORM_IMAGE=@THIN_LAYER_IMAGE@
C2_REPLAY_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-traffic
C2_BOX_MINUTES=60
